  identity: "a_provisional_verify_bound_is_a_bet_until_its_sample_is_recorded" as NonEmptyStr,

  rung: RungUnread { cause: BlockerClassUnstated },

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a verification entry with no recorded compile sample (gunbc.live_deploy.belt_cadence verify_entry_compile_samples) runs under a bound borrowed from the slowest recorded sample (VerifyRunProvisional). The figure is a bet, not a measurement of that entry.",

    "HARM: a borrowed figure far above the entry's real compile time inflates the receipt's derived bound and, through the slowest sample, the unit's outer kill limit, which widens the window in which a wedged run holds a compute seat; a figure far below it makes the outer limit kill an honest verification. Only the outer limit is enforced; the per-node bound is a receipt figure, so a low borrowed figure cannot kill a run through the per-node bound.",

